---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Cluster Replicator"
  description="Cross-cluster replication and disaster recovery wire-compatible with MirrorMaker 2."
  currentSlug="/docs/replicator"
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">Cluster Replicator</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2 text-base">
        Active-active cluster replication and offset translation via <code class="text-krab-300 font-mono text-xs">krabka-replicator</code>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
      <p>
        <code class="font-mono text-krab-300">krabka-replicator</code> mirrors topic partitions between independent Krabka and Apache Kafka clusters, translating consumer offsets to allow transparent consumer failover during disaster recovery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
